// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3275301948" "TAoE, Moderate DMG(Lethal), Minor DoT (Toxic), Knockback (Foe), -DMG(Foe, All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P111499529" "You fire numerous bullets at your target so fast that the eye cannot keep up. This causes a warped bullet trajectory, which causes lethal and toxic damage with each hit, as well as an additional chance to knock the target back. The lingering effects of the storm reduce the target's damage."
