"P161526169" "Weakening Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1914297799" "Ranged, -DMG(Foe, All), -DEF(Foe, All), -RES(Foe, Status Effects), -ToHit(Foe), -Heal(Foe), -End(Foe), Chance for High DMG(Toxic), Stun"
// Power Help Text :
"P462223306" "You fire a particularly potent round at your opponent. This round is full of toxins which catalyze those introduced by your other attacks. In addition to significantly weakening your opponent, these catalysts may alter the toxins in the target's bloodstream, causing additional damage and stunning them."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2211841663" "Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1367103757" "Your chance to hit, the strength of your attacks and the potency of your powers' status effects have all been reduced. Additionally, you may take additional damage and be stunned."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2076622043" "{PlayerSource} hits you with her {PowerName} and significantly weakens your body!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3355839467" "The accumulated poison in your body overwhelms you due to {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of toxic damage and stunning you briefly!"

