// Power Help Text :
"P2914557942" "You spin in the air with your blades, creating a swirling vortex of wind and dust which moves toward your target. This vortex causes smashing damage when it collides with the target and tosses them into the air. The dust and debris in the vortex choke and blind the targets caught in the vortex, reducing their chance to hit and their attack speed."
