// Power Help Text :
"P2480867476" "You unleash a frenzied attack, swinging your blades in a deadly dance of steel. This attack slashes all of those in a cone in front of you, dealing continuous lethal damage before delivering a final blow which can knock targets off their feet and reduce their resistances. There is a chance that a target will be stunned after this attack."
