// Power Help Text :
"P570093898" "You stab your blades into your target, drawing the life essence out of the target through your blades, healing you. The target suffers from a large wound which does not heal easily, causing lethal damage. The strain of such a wound also lowers their maximum HP, healing effectiveness, regeneration and recovery. Occasionally, it will also cause endurance loss."
